{"id":"n23981-1-13","stage":3,"title":"관람 · 观看","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23981-1-13-1","ko":"축구 좋아하세요?","zh":"您喜欢足球吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하세요?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/50a7ec3a1dd2293f9986.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23981-1-13-2","ko":"축구 경기 관람은 좋아하지만 직접 하는 것은 좋아하지 않아요.","zh":"我喜欢看足球比赛，但不喜欢亲自参加比赛。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경기","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"관람은","meaning":"观看，参观","explanation":"관람：观看，参观；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"관람","audio":"/audio/eb19ec902a177a5e9119.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23981","senseId":"1","lemma":"관람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하지만","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것은","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하지","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"eb19ec902a177a5e","term":"관람","zh":"观看，参观","audio":"/audio/eb19ec902a177a5e9119.mp3","entryId":"23981","definition":"观赏文物、画作、雕刻等展示品或演出、电影、运动比赛等。","pronunciation":["괄람"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/94a57d9338955b88329e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.705,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23981","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您喜欢足球吗？","我喜欢看足球比赛，但不喜欢亲自参加比赛。","孩子有什么问题吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您喜欢足球吗？","我喜欢看足球比赛，但不喜欢亲自参加比赛。","孩子有什么问题吗？"],"answer":1}]}
